// ============================================================
// The one sample-data pack. Design and preview time only - a production build never sees it.
// Shapes name the read model they supply rows for. Each domain's author adds the shapes of its own read models
// in its own marked section below (keep sections apart to avoid merge conflicts).
// ============================================================

